 drivers/rtc/Kconfig      |  11 ++
 drivers/rtc/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/rtc/rtc-jh7110.c | 324 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 336 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/rtc/rtc-jh7110.c

